{"message":"All three debit cards have been permanently closed immediately because they were reported lost: ending in 4582, 7391, and 8624. Any already-authorized pending transactions may still process, and recurring payments will need to be updated with replacement card details. I found no Rho-Bank credit cards on your profile.

Replacement timing varies by account: the cards linked to your Light Blue and Light Green accounts have a 48-hour wait after closure; the card linked to your Green account can be reordered immediately.

To arrange the replacements, please confirm:
1. Delivery speed for each: STANDARD (free, 7–10 business days), EXPEDITED, or RUSH;
2. Card design for each: CLASSIC (free), PREMIUM, or CUSTOM; and
3. Whether to mail them to your verified address on file: 3245 Sunset Boulevard, San Diego, CA 92103."}
